# Models & Generated Artifacts
# Note: models/scaler.pkl and kmeans models are kept if they are small and essential,
# but usually large .pkl files can be ignored if they are easily regenerated.
# Since the project regenerates models automatically on startup if missing, 
# we can optionally ignore large ones. But we will leave them tracked if they 
# were already committed unless they are too large.

# Large generated models
backend/models/*.pkl
